(text "J1/J2 pass the RP2040 I2C master bus through to the power board without a split cable.\nUART names are referenced to RP2040: BRIDGE_RX goes to ESP32-C3 TX.\nJ3 CM4 UART/control signals are isolated on the CM4 carrier during power off." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid a7b2af52-bce3-4a1d-b838-f6e3068f9507))
